# Build Complete Real-Time Speech-to-Text Application

You are a senior Python, FastAPI, React, WebRTC, and AI engineer.

Build a COMPLETE production-ready project called:

**LiveTranscribe**

A real-time speech-to-text application using Faster-Whisper.

## Main Goal

Create a desktop/web application that transcribes speech in real time.

Requirements:

* Speech → Text only
* No translation
* Only English and Japanese
* Real-time transcription
* Low latency
* Local inference
* Faster-Whisper backend
* Single modern frontend
* Works on Windows
* GPU acceleration when available
* CPU fallback

