# Features

## Real-Time Microphone Capture

Capture microphone audio from browser.

Use:

MediaRecorder
Web Audio API

Send chunks to backend every:

250 ms

through WebSocket.

---

## Voice Activity Detection

Use Silero VAD.

Ignore:

* silence
* keyboard noise
* background hum

Only process speech.

---

## Language Handling

Support only:

English
Japanese

Language Modes:

AUTO
ENGLISH
JAPANESE

AUTO:
detect language automatically

If language != en and != ja

discard transcript.

No translation allowed.

---

## Faster Whisper Configuration

GPU:

device="cuda"
compute_type="float16"

CPU:

device="cpu"
compute_type="int8"

Model configurable.

Default:

distil-large-v3

---

## Streaming Pipeline

Audio Chunk
↓
VAD
↓
Buffer
↓
Faster Whisper
↓
Partial Transcript
↓
Frontend

Return partial results immediately.

Do not wait for entire sentences.

---

## WebSocket API

/ws/transcribe

Events:

start
stop
partial_transcript
final_transcript
error
stats

JSON format.

